a car enthusiast or simply seeking an unforgettable VR adventure, this app offers a hyper-realistic journey through the world of automotive excellence.\n\nDownload now and transform your dream car into virtual reality!", "short_description": "Step into the ultimate VR car experience! Explore every inch of stunningly detailed vehicles in a breathtakingly realistic environment. \n\nChange colors on the fly, admire the sleek design from every angle, and dive into an immersive world where you control the details. Customize, explore, and live your automotive dream like never before!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tuningmaniaprivacypolicy.wordpress.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Default", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vrshowroom2.wordpress.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29412899008356632"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_683830391059418_3223037885410860006_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3i5nDXxU_GwQ7kNvwEbjcen&_nc_oc=AdnXlTp-fGB-SqQA3dFHifqspHa-CgoRsuiBKMSe1d64rVvDl_54tqajRru8tGQoa1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsjYtYftl4NQ7foan5H_D-5cp_xYEIzdrRS_WY0BuyOtA&oe=699EFA1F"}, "is_concept": fa